{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:26 2026-05-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:36 2026-05-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:36 2026-05-28 HKT</p><p>大嶼山有人行山失蹤。一名52歲男子昨日（27日）早上出門，獨自前往鳳凰徑第8段行山，惟徹夜未歸家。至今日（28日）早上8時45分，其妻子發現他一直失去聯絡，於是報警求助。</p><p>警方及消防接報後在石壁郊遊徑集合，出發登山搜索。消防處派出攀山拯救專隊（MSRT），救護車亦到場戒備；而政府飛行服務隊已接獲相關通知。至下午，人員在大嶼山狗嶺涌一帶使用無人機協助搜索。</p><img alt=\"男子獨行鳳凰徑失去聯絡。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4d63bf06eab7c62a243e4ef987304141/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8ebe74ee073862a0a6849f0b7ace599b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/60c7d2c8a9498e0af43b9e29ea5659ba/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6bfa75c4a4cf081526c477e7a3d7098a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"救護車到場戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c03cf45551bd94a1a3ea8a585476ee5a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/223396c040d9909d6ea90a2afbe0557e/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/676dd40a8fc2b05fc3870d593a48cc97/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_09.jpg\"/><img alt=\"人員在大嶼山狗嶺涌出動無人機協助搜索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f5d56cab7a4ebb0dffcf03681e494ba2/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_10.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2ca12b218df11794b598056092049297/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_12.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6ea58d7ba327c0cc8a909f9dafd576d3/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_13.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/166ccb80238d11bef0d566046f2ef1c7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_15.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/82437c461ef3b518767443adfad968d2/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_20.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2027795824139ebf948ad0aaf356f59c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_134026784.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5b060417c58d73648b94919b0dba2127/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_134026784_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f9a02940b6a5b66b226db23c9b0038fe/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_134026784_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/57463fad70d5bdfe7e73ffbf521562cb/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_134026784_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/953e1b5f63b3e61a578c798dce71714f/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_134640579.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a18e89562930dee6fd945c490063b392/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_134640579_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防處派出攀山拯救專隊（MSRT）進行搜救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/598156e4b7288c2bdf1f3fe679c04730/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_140224000.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1ed340d5ea5b2be9943b4bba55dd5562/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_22.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8a350e6bbd41e4d5cd0f2fef53586081/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260528_132716509_23.jpg\"/><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8e704341d8da613a497ebf13c85b7588/2026-05/Lantau_Trail_Stage_5_2_.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T06:20:36.013124+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":22,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}